name step
category Package
revision 57307
shortdesc A free Times-like font
longdesc The STEP fonts are a free Times-like (i.e., Times replacement)
longdesc font family, implementing a design first created for The Times
longdesc of London in 1932. These fonts are meant to be compatible in
longdesc design with Adobe's digitization of Linotype Times, commonly
longdesc used in publishing. The fonts were forked from XITS/STIX and
longdesc Type 1 support is provided for legacy TeX engines.
execute addMap STEP.map
containersize 1296664
containerchecksum d1f19415ceeefb879a3b4017fa286e5e5806e193fc75159b515fe21a9a6093c6a95d04e2e2e3c7ee457edb8ad717b88043c58727fb3924cb192e05aec12c5c07
